  "notes": "{炊|た}く specifically means to cook rice or grains by boiling.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb ({他動詞|たどうし}). Takes を particle.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ご{飯|はん}を{炊|た}く: to cook rice\n- {炊|た}きたて: freshly cooked\n- {炊飯器|すいはんき}: rice cooker\n- {炊|た}き{込|こ}みご{飯|はん}: mixed rice (cooked with ingredients)\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {炊|た}く: to cook (rice, grains)\n- {焚|た}く: to burn, kindle (fire, incense)\n\nCONTRAST WITH OTHER COOKING VERBS:\n- {炊|た}く: for rice/grains\n- {煮|に}る: to simmer, stew\n- {茹|ゆ}でる: to boil (pasta, vegetables)\n- {焼|や}く: to grill, bake",
